   "description": "Strong positive synergy: raising both values increases log-odds far more than the sum of their separate changes. Averaged over other inputs, the extra interaction is about +2.9 logits at l5=l8=10 versus their zero reference.",
   "where": "Becomes noticeable when both are around 2; steepens above roughly 4-6 and is strongest when both are 8-10."
  },
  {
   "inputs": [
    "age_c",
    "l10"
   ],
   "description": "High l10 attenuates the age-associated increase in log-odds; the average interaction contrast is about -0.96 logits at age_c=4 and l10=10 versus age_c=-4 and l10=0.",
